- **Credit-style ratings:** each safety score maps to paired **S&P** and **Moody's** letter grades (`AAA`/`Aaa` … `D`) and a top-level group — **Investment grade** (`AAA`–`BBB`) or **Speculative grade** (`BB`–`D`). See `lib/ratings/credit-rating.ts`.
